      "sign.shape_from_args always returned the scalar shape () regardless of input shape; it now returns self.args[0].shape.",
      "dist_ratio sublevel set used (1-tsq**2), i.e. 1-t^4, instead of (1-tsq), i.e. 1-t^2.",
      "PSD.residual used .T instead of .H, giving wrong results for complex Hermitian matrices.",
